<title>POLAND: CHEMISKOR AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>CHEMISKOR AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.15 vs   0.02</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.25 vs   0.03</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.04 vs   0.08</p>
<p> Sales		    1.09 vs   0.96</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.33 vs   0.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.57 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.40 vs   0.57</p>
<p> Sales		    7.82 vs   7.27</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish leather company is Chemiskor SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
